# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your real VirusTotal API key below.
# Get a free key at: https://www.virustotal.com (Sign up -> Profile icon -> API Key)
#
# The real .env file is git-ignored and will NEVER be pushed to GitHub.
# This .env.example file has no real secret in it, so it's safe to commit.

VT_API_KEY=paste_your_api_key_here
